census: the whole routine is censused: true
census: fission segments are censused: true
parity: at least one seed of a keyed segment executes: true
parity: every executed seed matches the default pipeline's step: true
parity: no seed fails to reach its segment, or raises: true
negative control: at least one perturbed seed executes: true
negative control: every executed perturbed seed is reported a mismatch: true
negative control: no perturbed seed fails to reach its segment, raises, or has nothing to perturb: true
tf32: some executed seed's reference is rounded to tf32: true
tf32 control: against the plain reference, nothing replayed, some tf32-rounded conv seed mismatches: true
tf32 replay: against the plain reference, the tied-at-zero window's flip is replayed and that seed matches: true
